      "body": "I got it working on my T9. Running 891. Gemini can help you generate an unlock code for the device and there's two helpful blog posts that address getting root. Then just cross compile and push everything to the device.\n\nThe refresh screen will be messed up, and the battery info isn't showing in the web gui but I'm hoping to dig into device specific changes that are needed soon but it runs just fine on the T9 without any modifications.",
